#RESIZE vs COMPRESSION
| Operation            | What happens?                                  |
| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| Resize               | Number of pixels/dimensions changes            |
| Lossless compression | File size decreases without losing information |
| Lossy compression    | File size decreases by discarding information  |
#DIGITAL IMAGE PROCESSING vs COMPUTER VISION
## Digital Image Processing (DIP).How can I modify or improve the image?
Examples: Noise removal/ Filtering/ Sharpening/ Contrast enhancement/ Histogram equalization/ Image restoration/ Thresholding/ Resizing
## Computer Vision (CV): What information can I understand or extract from the image?
Examples: Object detection/  Object recognition/ Face recognition/ Object tracking/ Vehicle counting/ ANPR/ Scene understanding
### Easy difference
DIP → Process the image
CV → Understand/extract information from the image
DIP can be used as a preprocessing stage in a CV pipeline.



